@startuml
title DNAT - Etapa 2
caption Mesmo com execucao em microVM, a falha ainda pode se alastrar para a VM inteira

left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFD
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #14324A
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 80
skinparam roundcorner 18
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #355C7D
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.4
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 140

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #4B6584
  FontColor #14324A
}
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #577590
  FontColor #14324A
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #577590
  FontColor #14324A
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor #F5F7FA
  BorderColor #829AB1
  FontColor #243B53
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF7D6
  BorderColor #D4B85F
  FontColor #5C4813
}
skinparam rectangle<<mainvm>> {
  BackgroundColor #EAF4FF
  BorderColor #2F6FB5
  FontColor #113A63
}
skinparam rectangle<<microvm>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDF2
  BorderColor #C0A000
  FontColor #6E5A00
}
skinparam database<<secret>> {
  BackgroundColor #E8ECFF
  BorderColor #5B6EE1
  FontColor #263A99
}

cloud "Codigo nao confiavel" as ATTACK

rectangle "CVM confidencial unica" <<mainvm>> as ALL {
  component "Frontend, APIs\ne controle" as CTRL
  rectangle "microVM executora" <<microvm>> as EXECM
  database "Dados sensiveis\nwallet, chaves,\ndatasets e artefatos" <<secret>> as SEC
}

ATTACK --> EXECM : entrada maliciosa
EXECM -[#C73E1D,dashed,thickness=2]-> CTRL : escape / movimento lateral
EXECM -[#C73E1D,dashed,thickness=2]-> SEC : leitura ou exfiltracao

note bottom of ALL
Separar somente o guest nao basta quando o host ainda concentra todas as funcoes criticas.
end note

@enduml
